        "content": "<p>I'm trying to define a typeclass for a preordered semiring like so:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Ring</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Defs</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Order</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Defs</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PartialOrder</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">POSR</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Semiring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Preorder</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_mono_left</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_mono_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">add_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_mono_left</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mono_left</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mono_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Since addition is commutative in a semiring, I should be able to prove <code>add_mono_right</code> from <code>add_mono_left</code>. Some issues with this: first, I don't  seem to be entering a proof state when I click next to or below <code>by</code>. Next, when I try to define <code>Nat</code> as an instance of <code>POSR</code>, as below:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddCommMagma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_comm</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">POSR</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_assoc</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_assoc</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">zero_add</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_add</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_assoc</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_assoc</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">one_mul</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">one_mul</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_one</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_one</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">zero_mul</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_mul</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_zero</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_zero</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">right_distrib</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">right_distrib</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_refl</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">le_refl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">le_trans</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">le_trans</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">nsmul_zero</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_mul</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">nsmul_succ</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">succ_mul</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">lt_iff_le_not_ge</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lt_iff_le_and_not_ge</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add_mono_left</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">omega</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mono_right</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">omega</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mono_left</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">succ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">left_distrib</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">omega</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>there are a few more issues:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Back in the proof of <code>add_mono_right</code> I had to add <code>intro x y z</code> even though they're already introduced to the left of the colon;</li>\n<li>I had to separately give the <code>AddCommMagma Nat</code> instance since that proof couldn't find <code>add_comm</code> otherwise;</li>\n<li>Now I get the errors <code>could not synthesize default value for field 'add_mono_right' of '_private.[...].POSR' using tactics</code> and <code>Unknown identifier `add_mono_left` </code>, so it can't see the <code>add_mono_left</code> field of the typeclass; and similarly,</li>\n<li>I had to prove <code>mul_mono_left</code> separately too because it doesn't see the <code>mul_mono_right</code> field I already defined.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Are later fields just not allowed to depend on earlier ones, or am I going about it wrong somewhere?</p>",
        "id": 625032385,
        "sender_full_name": "Jonathan Chan",
        "timestamp": 1789664714
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>when you write <code>field (arguments) : type := by tac</code> this is special syntax to run <code>tac</code> to fill in <code>field</code> as a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=autoParam#doc\">docs#autoParam</a>, which runs when you instantiate the constructor (which is why you don't see a tactic state, the tactic isn't being run). If you want it to run when you define the class you can instead do something like <code>:= (by tac)</code> or <code>:= id &lt;| by tac</code>, for example</p>",
        "id": 625042500,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1789667366
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>ohh that works, thanks!</p>",
